--- !u!114 &8619747884144957933
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1680277126811690134}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "J\xE4rvikaisla\n\nJ\xE4rvikaisla on lehdet\xF6n ja paksuvartinen kasvi,
      joka sekoitetaan usein j\xE4rviruokoon. Sen ruskeat kukinnot kasvavat pienin\xE4
      ryhmin\xE4. Se kasvaa j\xE4rviss\xE4 ja v\xE4h\xE4suolaisissa murtovesiss\xE4.\n\n\n\nOsmank\xE4\xE4mi\n\nSuomessa
      kasvaa kahta \nosmank\xE4\xE4milajia: leve\xE4- ja \nkapeaosmank\xE4\xE4mi.
      Ne ovat \nkorkeita kasveja, joilla on paksut varret ja tiivis kukinto, ja ne
      kasvavat matalassa vedess\xE4."
    sw: "S\xE4v\n\nS\xE4v \xE4r en bladl\xF6s och tjockstj\xE4lkad v\xE4xt som ofta
      f\xF6rv\xE4xlas med bladvass. Dess bruna blomst\xE4llningar sitter i sm\xE5
      grupper. Den v\xE4xer i sj\xF6ar och i svagt br\xE4ckta vatten.\n\n\n\nKaveldun\n\nI
      Finland v\xE4xer tv\xE5 arter \nav kaveldun: bred- och \nsmalkaveldun. Det
      \xE4r h\xF6ga \nv\xE4xter med tjocka stj\xE4lkar och t\xE4ta blomst\xE4llningar,
      som trivs i grunt vatten.\r\n"
    en: "Common club-rush\n\nCommon club-rush is a leafless, thick-stemmed plant
      that is often confused with common reed. Its brown inflorescences grow in small
      clusters. It grows in lakes and brackish waters.\n\n\n\nCattail\n\nTwo species
      of cattail \ngrow in Finland: the \nbroad-leaved cattail and \nthe narrow-leaved
      cattail. They are tall plants with thick stems and dense inflorescences, and
      they grow in shallow water."
